  "title": {
    "zh": "DIY插珠疯狂堡垒拼搭套装",
    "en": "DIY Crazy Fort Building Set"
  },
  "summary": {
    "zh": "这是一款儿童DIY插珠堡垒拼搭玩具，采用PP结构件，适用于家庭亲子互动、课程活动和创意搭建场景。\n\n品牌为尧顺，产地东莞茶山，适用年龄集中在4-6岁阶段，支持多次拆装与重复使用。",
    "en": "This is a kids DIY bead-and-rod fort building toy made with PP structural parts, suitable for parent-child interaction, classroom activities, and creative construction scenarios.\n\nBrand: Yaoshun. Origin: Chashan, Dongguan. It is mainly positioned for ages 4-6 and supports repeated assembly and reuse."
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": [
      "该款DIY插珠疯狂堡垒拼搭套装以拼接结构为核心，可围绕堡垒、通道和互动空间进行多形态搭建，适合儿童持续进行创意构建。",
      "产品面向亲子互动与启蒙益智场景，适用于家庭游戏、幼教活动和小组协作玩法，支持反复拆装使用。",
      "包装方式为其它常规形式，规格为1-1.5M，便于按渠道需求进行灵活配置与采购。"
    ],
    "en": [
      "This DIY crazy fort building set is based on an interlocking structure and supports multiple layouts around forts, tunnels, and interactive spaces for continuous creative play.",
      "It is designed for parent-child interaction and early educational play, and can be used in home games, preschool activities, and small-group collaborative scenarios with repeated assembly.",
      "The packaging uses a general packaging format with a 1-1.5M specification, suitable for flexible channel configuration and procurement."
    ]
  },
